### 1. GET all — happy path (правильні креди)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET all — bad credentials (неправильний пароль)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET one — happy path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET one — bad credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin1
Accept: application/json

### 5. POST (create) — happy path
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ноутбук Lenovo Legion",
  "description": "Ігровий ноутбук, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD"
}

### 6. POST (create) — bad credentials
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ноутбук Lenovo Legion",
  "description": "Ігровий ноутбук, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD"
}

### 7. PUT (update) — happy path
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Apple iPhone 15 - Знижка",
  "description": "Оновлена ціна для розпродажу"
}

### 8. PUT (update) — bad credentials
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Apple iPhone 15 - Знижка",
  "description": "Оновлена ціна для розпродажу"
}

### 9. DELETE — happy path
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 10. DELETE — bad credentials
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin1